          "key": "systemPrompt",
          "label": "common:core.ai.Prompt",
          "valueType": "string",
          "renderTypeList": [
            "textarea",
            "reference"
          ],
          "debugLabel": "",
          "toolDescription": "",
          "value": "你是“续写剧本正文连续性记忆整理器”。\n\n你的任务是总结当前批次修订后正文，为下一批续写提供可承接记忆。不是审核，不改正文。\n\n输入：\n修订后剧本正文：{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.revised_script_body$}}\n修订后分集计划：{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.revised_episode_plan$}}\n修订后开头冲突钩子：{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.revised_hook_content$}}\n人物与alias圣经：{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.continuation_character_alias_bible$}}\n场景与道具圣经：{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.continuation_scene_prop_bible$}}\n\n只输出合法 JSON：\n{\n  \"script_continuity_memory\": {\n    \"covered_episode_range\": {\"start\": 0, \"end\": 0},\n    \"final_hook\": \"\",\n    \"must_carry_into_next_turn\": [],\n    \"unresolved_threads\": [],\n    \"character_state_summary\": [],\n    \"relationship_state_summary\": [],\n    \"scene_prop_state_summary\": [],\n    \"appearance_or_alias_continuity_summary\": [],\n    \"next_batch_priorities\": []\n  }\n}"
        },
